903 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Wolters Kluwer\nSenior Product Designer\nJun 2021 \055 Jul 2026  \055  Internacional \055 Remoto\n\nB2B SaaS products for accounting firms and professional services\054 collaborating with international Product\054 Design and Engineering teams\056\n\n\042End\055to\055end product design\054 from discovery\054 user interviews and research to interaction design\054 prototyping\054 validation and developer handoff\056\n\042 Complex B2B solutions including document management\054 Dashboards\054 digital portals\054 task management\054 time tracking\054 e\055signature and tax\055related workflows\056\n\042 Worked in a fully international environment in English\054 collaborating with Product Directors\054 Architects\054 Domain experts and stakeholders across multiple markets\056\n\042 Contributed to the evolution of the global Design System\054 improving consistency\054 accessibility and reusability across products\056\n\042Applied generative AI and code\055assisted prototyping to accelerate exploration\054 documentation\054 validation and solution development\056\n\nFrog\nSenior Interaction Designer \055 frog\nFeb 2019 \055 Jun 2021 \055  Madrid\nDesigned digital products and connected experiences for Telef\363nica\054 one of the world\047s leading telecommunications companies\054 across mobile\054 TV and smart home platforms\056\n\n\042Designed consumer\055facing products including Smart WiFi\054 Secure Connection and Living Apps\054 ensuring seamless experiences across devices\056\n\042 Designed complex operational tools\054 including a CMS and partner dashboard used to create\054 manage and monitor Living Apps\056\n\042 Produced user flows\054 interaction models\054 high\055fidelity prototypes and design specifications for research\054 testing and development\056\n\042 Collaborated with multidisciplinary teams across Product\054 Engineering\054 Research and Business throughout the entire product lifecycle\056\n\042 Presented and defended design decisions by balancing user needs\054 business goals and technical feasibility\056\n\nFreelance UX designer\nDesigned digital experiences\054 websites\054 applications and branding projects for clients across different industries\056\n2018 \055 2019\n\nAccounting \046 Finance\nAccounting\054 invoicing\054 accounts receivable\057payable and bank reconciliations\056)
